      "impl": {
        "export": "FeatureGrid",
        "kind": "package",
        "module": "@clossys/designer/blocks"
      },
      "license": "MIT",
      "notes": [
        "The layout prop selects grid, list, split, bento, tabs, alternating or scroll. Bento delegates ordered 12-unit spans and the 2-6 item bound to the existing Items engine. Tabs delegates keyboard and panel semantics to components.tabs without autoplay; its authored header heading names the list. Alternating media uses logical grid columns and stacks below tablet. Scroll enhances a complete static list only when JavaScript, scroll-driven animation support and no reduced-motion preference are present; token animation timings, the shared section reveal and local sticky keyframes drive sticky media and stepped copy. Optional item.figure uses an existing image resource through sections.media; copy is supplied through the existing Writer header and item fields.",
        "Source-only import and token-read measurements are lower bounds; shared anatomy, accessibility, contrast and consumer runtime conformance remain unmeasured. Content bindings describe host adaptation points, not type-equivalent converters."
      ],
